00:37:27,546 --> 00:37:34,006
It was also the place where I realized how good we are now.

512
00:37:34,006 --> 00:37:40,246
We always talked about how it would be great if we could fill the Toyosi pit again someday, so we decided to do something else.

513
00:37:40,246 --> 00:37:45,966
I hope we can make this concert a place where we can show that we can do something else, and that we can do our best.

514
00:37:45,966 --> 00:37:49,866
I would like to end by singing that song one more time.

515
00:37:49,894 --> 00:37:57,494
With you, who reminded me of myself that I had forgotten

516
00:37:57,494 --> 00:38:03,494
I still knew the future we talked about

517
00:38:19,894 --> 00:38:22,134
mer
